<title>TANZANIA: 52 people feared killed in south Tanzania floods.</title>
<headline>52 people feared killed in south Tanzania floods.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Floods in a coastal area of southern Tanzania have killed 41 people and 11 are missing and feared dead, regional officials said on Friday.</p>
<p>President Benjamin Mkapa sent condolences to families of the victims of the floods, caused by downpours in Lindi region at the onset of the &quot;long rains&quot; season.</p>
</text>
